{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Funny Bones: Test Your Typing Speed and Spelling Skills in this Summoning Madness! \ud83c\udf83\ud83d\udc7b</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get ready for the spooky challenge of\u00a0<i>Funny Bones</i>! In this fast-paced Halloween themed\u00a0game, your mission is to spell out the body parts of each skeleton before it fades into the underworld. Complete one skeleton, and another appears\u2014but beware! The pace picks up with each new skeleton, challenging even the quickest fingers! \ud83d\udda4\ud83d\udc80</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Modes:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udcd6 <strong>Story Mode:</strong> where you find the mysteries of the necromancer's school.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u267e\ufe0f Infinite Mode: </strong>here you can put yourself to the challenge and compete against others to become a Summon Master.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features</strong>:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u26a1\u00a0<strong>Fast Reflexes Needed</strong>: Each round speeds up\u2014do you have what it takes to keep up with the skeleton swarm?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udcda\u00a0<strong>Educational &amp; Addictive</strong>: Test your anatomical knowledge and spelling skills in this brainy, fast-paced game.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udddb\u00a0<strong>Perfect for Halloween</strong>: With eerie visuals and thrilling music,\u00a0<i>Funny Bones</i>\u00a0plunges you into the spirit of the season.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prove who\u2019s the ultimate speller among the undead! \ud83d\udd78\ufe0f\ud83d\udc40</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>How to Play:\u00a0</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Type the words that fall using the keyboard\u00a0to summon the missing parts of the skeleton\u00a0\ud83e\uddb4\u2728</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Credits:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>Trailer Music</u>:\u00a0Hall of the Mountain King Kevin MacLeod </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Licensed under Creative Commons: By Attribution 3.0 License</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > - Remix: Red Monkey Studio.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>Keyboard UI</u>:\u00a0\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Skulls Initiate","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3896780/6c113e20277f33b3619d9eca67f0b1cf38691dd8.jpg"},{"name":"Skulls Apprentice","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3896780/ab461531d9882b48d3b2181e31648ebd1399bec9.jpg"},{"name":"Graduate","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3896780/2b9af113e8d5c67ddf8068cd10627c586989f7d6.jpg"},{"name":"Avid Reader","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3896780/6ca43b48de49c6cbaf96e970fcfa64940e9d000d.jpg"},{"name":"Excellent Performance","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3896780/62572b60282f9825ffaba66ec36ac20581825c6c.jpg"},{"name":"Infinite Mode","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3896780/41790d519ba98aca18abc24cdd64bd01fe5dcc53.jpg"}],"total":6},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3896780?t=1761929255","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3896780?t=1761929255","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3896780/8391a152d0bb1f5a0f854f8757e86a89f06be9eb/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761929255","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3896780/8391a152d0bb1f5a0f854f8757e86a89f06be9eb/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1761929255","categories":[{"description":"Single-player"